XR18 Scene Placeholder — Performance

Replace this file with your exported XR18 Scene.

Intended settings
- Sample rate: 48 kHz
- Source: ch 13–18 = USB (Card 13–18); ch 1–12 = Analog
- Safety: Main LR OFF on ch 13 (Click) and 14 (Cues)
- IEM: Bus taps Pre‑EQ; Aux Out 1–5 → Bus 1–5 (if using XR18 Buses)
- Ultranet: assign slots per docs/ultranet-routing.md
